  "modification": "Tudor-inspired exterior candidate assembled from approved hall/house, roofed tower, brick enclosure and arched entrance meshes; red-brick tint in derived materials only. Original mesh, UV and binary chunks preserved. Four towers, two wings, great hall exterior and open courtyard. Not a historically verified palace; octagonal tower profile, interior, exact gate clearance, native collision and visual QA remain pending. Verified original tower shafts have eight radial directions at four sampled heights; kept original mesh. Adjusted front and side wall spans and added two rear enclosure pieces. Static gate-to-courtyard ray clearance verified; no native collision or historical accuracy claim.",
